{
  "_comment": [
    "A game mid-turn, for capturing the board without a live socket.",
    "",
    "Shaped to be the hardest version of the layout rather than the tidiest: a long card name",
    "that has to fit a 108px hand card, a full seven-card hand that must pan, permanents on",
    "both sides, a two-deep stack, tapped and summoning-sick creatures, and counters so the",
    "printed stats have to be adjusted. A capture of an empty board proves nothing.",
    "",
    "The opponent's hand is null and neither library appears at all, because that is what the",
    "server actually sends — a fixture that included them would let a leak pass the audit."
  ],
